<div class="container">
    <h1 class="doc-h1">Branch Sync &amp; Conflict Assist Plan</h1>

    <div class="last-updated" class="doc-muted">
        Last Updated: 2026-08-09 |
        Version: 0.01 |
        Author: Hermes (on request) |
        Status: DRAFT for review — no code written yet
    </div>

